<title>GERMANY: Mercedes aims for profit on trucks in Europe.</title>
<headline>Mercedes aims for profit on trucks in Europe.</headline>
<dateline>HOCKENHEIM, Germany 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mercedes-Benz AG is aiming to make a profit from trucks it sells in Europe in 1998, Chairman Helmut Werner told journalists on Wednesday.</p>
